WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.113
[Low strings as the order is given]

00:01.133 --> 00:02.080
[Rotor blades turn as the squad moves]

00:02.100 --> 00:03.380
[Rotors beat as the tracked vehicle lifts]

00:03.400 --> 00:05.113
[Helicopter rotors over the suspended vehicle]

00:05.133 --> 00:07.513
[Tank tracks approach along the village road]

00:07.533 --> 00:08.213
[Tank tracks rumble]

00:08.233 --> 00:09.913
[Fire cracks beside the trench]

00:09.933 --> 00:11.013
[Mortar fires from the sandbag pit]

00:11.033 --> 00:12.680
[The round strikes the field]

00:12.700 --> 00:15.080
[Boats approach the shore]

00:15.100 --> 00:16.480
[Surf as the squad runs ashore]

00:16.500 --> 00:18.580
[Patrol boats close on the harbour entrance]

00:18.600 --> 00:20.613
[Jet engines rise over the coast]

00:20.633 --> 00:21.447
[Short mechanical clacks as the bombs drop]

00:21.467 --> 00:23.880
[The jet recedes as the rush of falling air builds]

00:23.900 --> 00:25.447
[Bombs strike beside the truck]

00:25.467 --> 00:28.047
[Tracks and rifle fire as infantry advance]

00:28.067 --> 00:31.380
[Rifle fire cracks from the trench]

00:31.400 --> 00:34.880
[Heavy artillery bursts roll across the trenches]

00:34.900 --> 00:37.380
[The barrage echoes as the music resolves]
